    {
        dataType="Comment";
		class PositionInfo {position[]={0,0,-8};};
        title="Transport Services (guided example): all three vehicles already contain correctly sided WEST AI drivers. Their init fields only register the existing transports; they never create crew. Use ACE Self Interact > WMP Transport to request a service. Raven One uses the 1.5x landing-clearance multiplier; Boat One searches open water up to 400 m and rejects a landlocked click. Keep simulation enabled; move Boat One onto/adjacent to water before saving. See the minimal composition for the shortest calls. Wiki: https://github.com/AdamWaldie/WaldosMissionPack/wiki/Transport-Services";
        id=3;
